WEBVTT

00:36.583 --> 00:38.415
I think we're almost finished here.

00:38.416 --> 00:39.541
Thank you.

00:42.000 --> 00:43.874
Hey, I thought Nathalie
had a treatment tonight?

00:43.875 --> 00:46.291
No, it was pushed until tomorrow.

00:47.958 --> 00:50.291
If you guys need anything,
just let me know.

00:54.666 --> 00:55.999
So who are they?

00:56.000 --> 00:57.958
Nathan and Bridget Bischof.

00:58.625 --> 01:02.333
Twenty-four years of age. Married.
Both had priors for dealing.

01:07.541 --> 01:10.666
- Were they the only ones here?
- Yeah, we searched the place.

01:26.041 --> 01:27.125
What's up?

01:33.875 --> 01:35.583
What are you looking for?

01:58.958 --> 02:00.582
Hello, Detective Müller.

02:00.583 --> 02:02.332
- It's me, yes.
- Nice to meet you.

02:02.333 --> 02:04.040
- And this must be Martin.
- Yeah.

02:04.041 --> 02:05.082
Hello, Martin.

02:05.083 --> 02:07.125
I'm going to show you around, okay?

02:07.791 --> 02:11.832
Look, Martin, there are a lot of nice
places here where you can have fun.

02:11.833 --> 02:13.499
Yes, it's nice here.

02:13.500 --> 02:18.666
We place children all over the world
to deserving families.

02:20.583 --> 02:23.749
Martin, Olivia will
take you inside now, okay?

02:23.750 --> 02:25.000
Go ahead.

02:26.375 --> 02:28.208
Don't worry, Detective Müller.

02:28.916 --> 02:32.540
We will find Martin a wonderful new home.

02:32.541 --> 02:33.750
I promise.

02:37.583 --> 02:39.165
Everything will be okay.

02:39.166 --> 02:40.750
You'll be fine here.

02:41.458 --> 02:43.750
See you soon, Martin, okay?

03:20.166 --> 03:21.249
Detective Müller?

03:21.250 --> 03:24.083
How long has it been since Martin Bischof
went missing from the orphanage?

03:24.666 --> 03:27.624
- About five years. Why?
- There's something you should see.

03:27.625 --> 03:29.207
This just came in over Interpol.

03:29.208 --> 03:32.375
It came from an agent
at the Boston FBI field office.

03:33.375 --> 03:34.832
Matthew Burroughs.

03:34.833 --> 03:37.666
The family who ran the orphanage
was also from Boston.

03:48.000 --> 03:50.665
Exact same
physical similarities as Martin.

03:50.666 --> 03:53.000
- Yes.
- And the timeline matches.
